The "AI Platform on EKS" project deploys the following third-party software. This
file records attribution and licensing.

With one exception this repository does NOT vendor (copy in) any third-party
work. The exception is the two font files the cluster dashboard serves, listed
first below with their license. Everything after that is **deployed or fetched
at runtime** — components this project pulls from their official container
registries, Helm repositories, or (for the Gateway API Inference Extension
CRDs) a pinned upstream Git tag at deploy time. This repository does not
redistribute them; it references them by image tag, chart version, or Git tag.
They remain under their own licenses, listed here for attribution and operator
awareness. Verify the exact license of the pinned version before you rely on it.

